data: {"id": "8e57a297c3d7404a-thinking-parallel_evidence-1179", "run_id": "8e57a297c3d7404a", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "根据已有工具结果，采集到以下关键事实：\n\n**实体身份**：`aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn`，Phase=Running，但 Ready=False，Reason=ContainersNotReady。\n\n**支撑\"Error\"候选的证据：**\n- Events：`BackOff restarting failed container app`，已重复198次，跨度48分钟。\n- `kubectl_previous_logs` 和 `kubectl_logs` 均返回3条相同的错误日志，`level=error`，`message=CONFIG_MISSING`，`http_status=500`。这表明容器启动后立即抛出 `CONFIG_MISSING` 异常并终止，随后被 Kubelet 反复重启。\n- `kubectl_get_yaml`：`restarts=14`，`reason=CrashLoopBackOff`，`exitCode=78`。exitCode 78 对应应用层返回 500 后主动退出。\n\n**冲突/缺口：**\n1", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788794706222, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

