data: {"id": "8e57a297c3d7404a-final", "run_id": "8e57a297c3d7404a", "seq": 1184, "ts_ms": 1788794726155, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn` | Error | Pod workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_terminated_reason`: Error | 确认容器最后一次终止原因为异常退出 |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.last_exit_code`: 78 | 明确应用进程主动退出的退出码 |\n| 3 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Back-off restarting failed container app ... (x198 over 48m)` | 确认 Pod 处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态 |\n| 4 | Logging | Elasticsearch | `pattern`: CONFIG_MISSING, `http_status`: 500, `path`: /work | 应用日志确认启动时因配置缺失报错并返回 500 |\n| 5 | Tracing | Deepflow/Tempo | `GET /work` → 500, `span`: `aiops.observed_mode=config_missing_exit` | Trace 数据印证日志中的配置缺失导致请求立即失败 |\n\n证据内容说明：\n1. 日志（#4）与 Trace（#5）交叉印证：两者均捕捉到针对 `/work` 端点的 500 错误，且 Trace 明确标注了 `config_missing_exit` 模式，证实应用启动后立即因配置缺失终止。\n2. K8s 状态（#1, #2）与事件（#3）结合：确认应用因异常退出（Exit Code 78）且原因归类为 Error，进而触发 Kubelet 的重启机制。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n```text\n应用启动依赖的配置项缺失 → 应用主动抛出 CONFIG_MISSING 错误并返回 HTTP 500 → 应用进程以 exitCode 78 终止 → Kubelet 触发 CrashLoopBackOff 重启机制\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n已确认根因为应用启动时依赖的关键配置项缺失。证据链显示，应用启动后检测到配置缺失（日志 fact-1dc34210d4bd），主动终止进程并返回 Exit Code 78 及 HTTP 500 状态（事实 #4, #5）；Kubelet 捕获到容器的 Error 终止状态（事实 #1）后，按照预期重启容器，导致 Pod 陷入 CrashLoopBackOff 状态（事实 #3）。\n\n缺失的确定性事实包括：具体缺失的环境变量名或 ConfigMap key（日志仅概括为 `CONFIG_MISSING`），以及 ConfigMap `workload-code` 的当前实际内容是否与代码预期不匹配。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.6m\n├─ 问题定位: 16.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 72.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn: 72.2s (Evidence 61.2s, RCA 10.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.8s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-07/workload-dff5cbc6b-fkzvn**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 97.332, "metrics": {"run_id": "8e57a297c3d7404a", "mttr": {"value": "1.6m", "seconds": 97.3374011516571, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "51%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.95, "weighted_score": 0.19, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 95%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 97337.4011516571, "llm_calls": 10, "llm_duration_ms": 66986.56892776489, "tool_calls": 11, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 90508.67748260498, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 29905.07459640503}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 16345.032453536987, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 72182.52635002136, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 8786.722660064697, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

